17:T962,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When is the Chevening 2027–2028 deadline?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The new scholarship application deadline was 6 October 2026 at 11:00 UTC and the round is closed. Later interview and university-offer milestones concern existing applicants."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Chevening fully funded?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chevening describes a funded package for eligible study and related support, but candidates should read the current terms for exact benefits, limits and personal costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need a university offer before applying to Chevening?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Follow the current Chevening timeline and course guidance. Scholarship and university admission stages are separate, with later offer requirements in the process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Pakistani students apply for Chevening?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, when they meet all current eligibility and course rules. Use the official country and application guidance rather than relying on a third-party eligibility decision."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use one example in every Chevening answer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A strong application normally uses complementary evidence. Repeating one story can leave other criteria unsupported and make the profile seem narrow."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Chevening scholarship application the same as applying to a UK university?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Chevening and university admissions are connected but separate processes. Applicants must manage the scholarship timeline and their eligible course applications independently."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Chevening itself require IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chevening removed its own English-language requirement, but applicants still need to meet the admission conditions of their selected UK universities."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why should I track the university-offer stage separately?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The scholarship submission deadline and the later requirement for an eligible unconditional university offer are different milestones. Missing either can affect the application."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/chevening/\",\"name\":\"Chevening Scholarships 2027–2028 application guide\",\"description\":\"Understand the Chevening application route, UK university steps, funding and key milestones, then verify the current intake on official Chevening sources.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/chevening/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-02\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-13\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/programme-research-editorial.webp\",\"caption\":\"Students working through programme information and application notes\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org\"}}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Scholarships\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Chevening Scholarships 2027–2028 application guide\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/chevening/\"}]}"}}],["$","scri